==German==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|de|la}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|ampel}}, {{m|gmh|ampolle}}, {{m|gmh|ampulle}}, from {{inh|de|goh|ampla}}, {{m|goh|ampulla|t=vessel}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*ampullā|t=flask, cruse}}. The sense development was ''vessel'' → ''hanging lamp (in or shaped like a vessel)'' → ''traffic light''. {{doublet|de|Ampulle}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʔampl̩/|/ˈʔampəl/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Ampel.ogg|a=Germany}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Ampel.ogg|a=Austria}}

